{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36469","headline":"献池州庾员外 · 罗邺","name":"献池州庾员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾降瑶缄荐姓名，攀云几合到蓬瀛。\n须存彭寿千年在，终见茅公九转成。\n鲲海已知劳鹤使，萤窗不那梦霓旌。\n琪花玉蔓应相笑，未得歌吟从酒行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}